  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Assisted Voluntary Return and Reintegration in the Country of Origin - RESTART-ing</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The general objective of the project is to continue supporting the efforts of the Government of Malta in making Assisted Voluntary and Reintegration (AVRR) available to Third Country Nationals (TCNs) so requiring, this way contributing to increase the effectiveness of overall migration management.Based on IOM Malta&#x2019;s experience, nurtured during the implementation of six phases of the RESTART project, within the framework of which between 2009 and 2022 a total of 428 returnees were assisted, this project aims at assisting 65 TCNs &#x2013; over 11 months - in their safe dignified return and sustainable reintegration home by applying consolidated practices and innovative tools to address their evolving needs .</narrative>
  </description>
